WEBVTT

NOTE
VoxScribe Review Sample Transcript for App Review testing.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.400
Interviewer: Thanks for joining today. Could you describe how you currently capture and analyze interview recordings?

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:15.700
Participant: I usually record the session, send the audio for transcription, then copy important passages into a spreadsheet for coding.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:21.200
Interviewer: What slows you down the most when you move from transcript review to analysis?

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:31.000
Participant: The hardest part is keeping codes, notes, and evidence connected while I compare themes across multiple interviews.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.500
Interviewer: If you could export one report for your team, what should it include?

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:45.000
Participant: I would want coded excerpts, timestamps, short memos, and a summary of how often each theme appeared.
